Concept ACK.
 Left some comments that I think will improve the code. Also, maybe it would be better for reviewers if you could split the first commit into two: One for the new rpc and the other for the test.

While reviewing, I noticed a lot of the code of `listrawtransaction` is from `listtransaction`. I though that it would be better if we created a helper function so we don't have duplicated code.
